<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prime Service started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prime Service started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it had started coverage of Prime Service Inc with a rating of near- and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The rental equipment company's shares closed at 24-1/8 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
